的美国士兵（他&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/oI_Bo4oraUGb74K2y-6aR3RJWeCAN4uVwGl0n34DXyTioGM2VGgfv_ToYhoiWPmfVE24iXgJIAFa8GUYh5tcu4I3Su_HXe6MkEFMDnL25Krqn6lLoA-OP3rqFiWERXlB9Gbg1VHD2KJxZkrDxy4epnO1PcuyKfDauMYOPEkMJfZmuy8A_xYry-HuUXLzAmX7qEyCwjtrXA3j42dQL-1ALeMlFo0UhOFYCNZf6yuxobeVcc77K27s4c9qZWtetXBQhgXBChqi9xxzwTCU3fNi3mR6CUVCZdBfUbQU4Vi0Cz9ICH9nUHW8TjrxerjMOw8w00dxSM-ynjTnOYhbK90IqgpLf2yY3y7GJnbU3EhvCA/Ud-g0_WbwsKcZQj4Wx2wE8VOLFPAnzms/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="特朗普否认有关他称军人为“失败者”和“傻瓜”的报道"&gt;否认了&lt;/a&gt;这些指控），并通过多次推迟服役来避免参加越南战争，其中一次推迟是因为诊断出&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/0G-Dm_T-twA5_7HXAIi0mWB0PvoO6Yzo8VMxbb113bFT3fE_9Pj-p2KcV9857_vr7ti_hlhhzi5gapoR4THXLp0IDCNEhyYBmCBzrV7uGcM_Ajr4qt6PJuKjXt4MlSQlLBO-1f5NbIpy-Z8C8fG9orbiNhlgstanKT_pem56AC9FHqh4A1w1AXqcaRDEsDYNzaNbcM17PQ6wFb4gxtwjeLetXO8gNgyHekkA-BiWWs_9-TV7wp2T6n8KTJ4r7CfkglyOApMZc6L35zC2y3sMsENvcfrnblkbWq-dTxX7QMtalrAJZfQ7xe5O9KHF7qc6NCtUWUAyNu0Bv_emr6qOd4h1pSMNURjk-3vYadiLXkluEJ6TjZPFgHOBgsWfWxLbGFVn3mm1kNG1GHtuSzdp9B2Fh0eHsZjUUA/sa2jZlLokvZTFQ3i__lwaCc1NQ9k4sta/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="麦凯恩因越南“骨刺”延期而猛烈抨击总统"&gt;骨刺&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;美国参议员鲁本·加列戈表示，他将呼吁两党对林肯号进行监督访问。这位民主党人在社交媒体帖子中写道：“很明显，唐纳德·特朗普本人逃避了现役，他根本不关心我们服役人员的健康和安全。” &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/LJikLN1lz9QnnjO6YTvDHs71LO_UAa8TQR1wqZa3YWUVT8FGoTvYBawGeVNYwymBeWXBjGmAkbPQzJSw6J5OGVbDY1pF2OzIo8FaCu-5CaaK6n7ccXc7oPSSyuQR9t89kVXhpkyy6zuv6w6GI51N6yCEspu_q-KJnTzj5kZTXXQpISDuiBH_KHYNP7Mzff28RT055uTpv5U0l_YjrTMtMW9DVH698nYTPV5J0Y2jee8xIi7RJicJObWCFKhIk7XknB1dNeBGLdW4p3c9Lsqq0FHCpmilPX3k8tAXWxhYsAnfti1yH-sOr8Uo2897NFaeKhX1ZQ1VPJRTCp8lqdB9-oueXgLArRM0qaMePefuHd88hXwXHEj3l0U_FQUygQweY5F3K3ITzuBAZRkocUPJ7iWUXc5n79BQdYu_M6YDNkgDn9eejjl7NZVtHr1u3hdSTqBV51O8J1FZpBxk69rIHmqkeaFpJZ9wivtVp