a&gt;称，出于财务考虑，微软暂停了部分碳清除采购。该公司表示当时该计划尚未&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/0yFypsxQTW8w60zxUdpIKIyadiO-cWL-uF_M_jDn7A476VpweUikK_Pssrb0z7biI1Q1_Qk8lk8H_d_iloeB-61zneSIu-WkuFownGaHfLiXNd1UOVXriFSVoVhgEl5BZhc53ApRdOuZaW6GSTdhqFCcOQo8CFnjLdnkY_cfPYkCHtGEL-bBKcRF2WKKVFv_PSKT2ksTJC-iW1zzY2ckYF5xkOpNB0ER-GSAMXkYJOgltniEcoftyNPhXBWS2J4jEIMPXLlhPkhrG19Em_qVicQQHkgYk6xXCq-XwG37fPyVhIMynNsgd0OHgRfygbrCzblZ7pCi-In_bb-EX9kzId-gl65oavoZet5wXqnT5uIhmgDVzG7RvkyjPhj9fB6vuXPTqhr3-PqaqV1ZT6EOMe2I8g_l4MqDnz8JSpa1SpoJlzTkaF80QYaUG8amzdb5vGGkbDVq0wcBjOA_BgmGkvj6bzihyvVYhcXLkayTDU91BkeLJu_7vipJPF8mXDn9kLxiKsAivlV3QewzJXYCZHcdiuNhd1ydK5N3XZCDj0auBUokoM8I2_mutQ/o8tYmPkZI4X3dL2nZZjWerNrUSQacYWF/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="微软否认将削减碳业务的猜测"&gt;结束&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;微软在给彭博新闻社的电子邮件回复中表示，购买清除积分只是其脱碳之路的一个支柱。该公司发言人表示：“我们所做的任何调整都是我们纪律方法的一部分，而不是野心的改变。” &lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/wYii2pdE2y5_hczfJrTCsflvFXW007T5eipPivb5qkzkJtj2wIvVmB8ANn_54slIOVOl3lIA0e7jTsV9Ste72K2MSjfQijuBiHUlbeC-69CCm8NcXq89Xn3EI4l2rWU_NQTGOX_H4FH2lOd_SR8xZI6vPq1GNS2Rln1p5dHgMOiN0HCkHhJA5GtdYo_VyY_gXYWiykEzPGe6x6G8SB5qMmGx402uV6KMRYKWgwMehNXQP9XpsCKN2yR70Q-rCw7ku9-0sqDPJbN7O1piwelGda7k8finc9JncwUYqVoKwHTX0hGxPvngigXj42G4IGEQqzWLhFZTAX2-E7uIANxWDTZ9ST0fpPLvaWKbhkToLQUUNdgE7nI1bbgWW9_riTPHfqWjACz8jz00HCV0gNKPSvjliYhazOGkjmZAvdjqhzjDq8JhLoMZh-XwQQQbzbhFJJLaioCZaJpjR18M_CZH28AUm2XrUBe8cp28Sr97QMB5iKppqOBa_hbEX2cIsU22oXJtO0K6Lazi9-PsQz5gKWQE4ElwAc6fP80tBzEZXuWH-EhDKUd-CLk/njM2STJC5gjnnSbAQrLlFFqkDM-kUX3l/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e; text-decoration: none !important;" target="_blank" title="微软在人工智能推动下将碳去除产品的采购量减少了 80%"&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; margin: 24px 0 0 0; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; font-size: 14px !important; color: #000 !important; tex