gt;&lt;img alt="替代" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/izhE7BlJ2.fU/v6/-1x-1.jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;昨天，卡利避难所中因地震而流离失所的居民。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic;"&gt;摄影师：Nathalia Angarita/彭博社&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;印度尼西亚总统普拉博沃·苏比安托&lt;/strong&gt;在一次重要讲话中猛烈抨击官僚、国企、警察和军队的腐败和浪费问题，在投资者和选民对他的政策越来越感到不安之际，展现了他&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/9UwhNf7AX5vSUiq_qj5Cd2xYZibO9dpeMEFv6WLjHIgk0zeoZIsgGi9P5qBHE7eipi2XXHboq4EVoUs6ISkor5ezaCQfC4dKdiY52WErje0KfSRS31Ym8XMwbRpFqmoxubWtxB3XEXu0XUIJjvhflFu1MA7H688OYZ0XHwq-oQ_M643vW1CiKFfkkwulg9sPD5v4C0f3esICQD1KlnUZC9UICRhK4pb06DR_MsflcUUIZmMQhvqLQA86lVQ6pht-8BQPvDAiMVNyZ8eCCFFw-LODVzQz-0_jPobam6qPi8x9FDnnn0PsqUVKP4LABrpbJzLOyb2ifoZycO-lszohXNEsH3r0vAjZEFbaDn_G-5d_JH_f8U8a_wdZm7p-gLycszUgsS5r8ar_9PC9u6xTnVnda-W8kAj--mgOe8eeAE2K1xAaW90cf-g6G60NyWFsqt8OCwLNZ2_fwueeki-XkK-XGCc6mNtJ5aYHQZdAQZt90D3WBwv9btnsWF8TrcolIpzGiyQHHU9mdhVqZcJts6Ar_m7ppsulYf-hZ9yj7fSv/m7bJHyENLN5w321dhn_Ghj1sUcewm361/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="普拉博沃开辟印尼反腐新战线"&gt;强硬的执政风格&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;在新西兰情报机构称北京正在对新西兰&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/k3_rAY3XY_ZJjZMJ8elLCxMsX8q1BPj00mySd24MBXdqQsjHsq7gY1eBa5ogX62YtiHkZjeHZ5FCL6aGa0U8z5hxsE4SYzVhSaH8rzMP0PypeBzdYd6BBWTBLblPxZAZR0ICUOi2ZCiYKcc9raypiEpGR-G1694c-xuxfHvfUYNVT9hjGL8ngOx4mAiAkFEL69fecTM6vgkiTSK-tEnx6_fZZwk1m67aMba6QIYamq5w6MuU0SBRpJLmumm67W2wX5FVjVLelaIGwDMRewZzrNKoKaVfAubjrhoaRPa9UK6TCc7MHiQCpj_7R4hf_czVKpc_miG9X57ue2MQYBRQ22XvH4bddUzTNBSnuUFO4neEch1j76GPKIj_311pzRcjuVimTdQjP0VAnuWRPqCE0qyceCHnjDy6TNwe0eSuceCYyQQjjOOGVNeLcAbexRpjzSDHj